:: Arcology X-Change Station
<<location "arcology_xstation">><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>>
You enter the X-Change Station. Above the counter, a hologram shows a large pill slowly turning in the air.
<br><br>
You notice a screen showing what you're allowed to buy with your current access level.
<br>
<<holo "X-CHANGE STATION / ACCESS">>
	<<holoRow "YOUR ACCESS LEVEL" `($xchange.arcology.clearance or "guest").toUpperCase()`>>
	<<holoRow "GUEST PURCHASE LIMIT" `$daily.arcologyXStation ? "USED TODAY" : "1 PURCHASE AVAILABLE"`>>
	<<holoLine "MORE SERVICES ARE ONLY AVAILABLE TO RESIDENTS OR HIGHER" "warn">>
<</holo>>
<br>
<<arcologyicon "news">><<link [[Read the product guide (0:05)|Arcology X-Change Guide]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<arcologyicon "xcounter">><<link [[Guest counter|Arcology X-Change Counter]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<arcologyicon "controls">><<link [[Advanced services|Arcology X-Change Advanced]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Arcology Street]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>

:: Arcology X-Change Guide
<<location "arcology_xstation">><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>>
Next to the counter, you see a screen showing information about the X-Change pills. When you look at it, you hear a calm voice reading the information aloud.
<br><br>
<<holo "X-CHANGE / PILL INFORMATION">>
	<<holoRow "PINK PILL" "CHANGES YOUR BODY TO FEMALE">>
	<<holoRow "BLUE PILL" "CHANGES YOUR BODY TO MALE">>
	<<holoRow "BASIC" "3 PILLS PER PACK. EACH PILL LASTS ABOUT 1 DAY">>
	<<holoRow "NOW" "1 PILL PER PACK. LASTS ABOUT 6 HOURS">>
	<<holoLine "PILLS WITH LONGER EFFECTS AND SPECIAL TYPES ARE ONLY AVAILABLE TO RESIDENTS" "warn">>
<</holo>>
<br>
At the bottom of the screen, you notice a warning written in much smaller letters: <i>The Station is not responsible for anything you do while using X-Change, or for anything other people do to you while you're using it.</i>
<br><br>
<<link [[Back|Arcology X-Change Station]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Arcology X-Change Counter
<<location "arcology_xstation">><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<run ArcologySfx.cue("scan")>>
At the counter, a staff member points a scanner at the small light behind your ear. The staff member checks the scanner's screen, then smiles.
"You're registered as a guest. You can buy one product from this list each day, and you'll need to pay with Cipher."
<br><br>
<<if $daily.arcologyXStation>>
	<span class="blue">You've already bought something here today</span>. You can buy more tomorrow.
	<br><br>
<<else>>
	The staff member sets an open white pill case beside the price list and waits for your choice.
	<br><br>
	<<set _xsItems to [["xchange_pink_basic", "Pink Basic, pack of 3", "pinkBasic", 3, "xchangePink"], ["xchange_blue_basic", "Blue Basic, pack of 3", "blueBasic", 3, "xchangeBlue"], ["xchange_pink_now", "Pink NOW", "pinkNow", 1, "xchangePink"], ["xchange_blue_now", "Blue NOW", "blueNow", 1, "xchangeBlue"]]>>
	<<for _xsItem range _xsItems>>
		<<set _xsP to setup.arcologyPrice.quote(_xsItem[2])>>
		<<set _xsLabel to _xsItem[1] + " (" + _xsP.label + ")">>
		<<if setup.arcologyPrice.affordable(_xsP)>>
			<<capture _xsItem _xsLabel>><span class="arc-priced"><<pillicon _xsItem[4]>><<link _xsLabel "Arcology X-Change Counter">><<if setup.arcologyPrice.pay(_xsItem[2])>><<set $pharmacyItem to setup.pharmacyItems[_xsItem[0]]>><<pharmacyAddOwned _xsItem[3]>><<boughtOnce>><<unset $pharmacyItem>><<set $daily.arcologyXStation to true>><</if>><</link>></span><</capture>>
		<<else>>
			<<pillicon _xsItem[4]>><span class="blue"><<print _xsLabel>></span>
		<</if>>
		<br>
	<</for>>
	<<arcologyPriceNote _xsP>>
	<br>
<</if>>

<<link [[Back|Arcology X-Change Station]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Arcology X-Change Advanced
<<location "arcology_xstation">><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>>
After passing the guest counter, you find a large glass wall blocking the way into another part of the X-Change Station.
At the back of the area, there is a lift, but you can't find any button to call it.
<br><br>
A holographic display shows a list of services and what level of access you need to use them.
<br><br>
<<holo "X-CHANGE STATION / RESTRICTED SERVICES" `setup.arcology.hasClearance("resident") ? "ok" : "denied"`>>
	<<holoRow "BODY CUSTOMISATION" `setup.arcology.hasClearance("resident") ? "AVAILABLE" : "RESIDENT ACCESS REQUIRED"`>>
	<<holoRow "SPECIALIST FORMULAS" `setup.arcology.hasClearance("resident") ? "AVAILABLE" : "RESIDENT ACCESS REQUIRED"`>>
	<<holoRow "BLUEPRINT PRINTING" `setup.arcology.hasClearance("citizen") ? "AVAILABLE" : "CITIZEN ACCESS REQUIRED"`>>
	<<holoRow "PILL MODIFICATION" `setup.arcology.hasClearance("citizen") ? "AVAILABLE" : "CITIZEN ACCESS REQUIRED"`>>
	<<holoRow "PREMIUM SYNTHESIS" `setup.arcology.hasClearance("authority") ? "AVAILABLE" : "AUTHORITY ACCESS REQUIRED"`>>
<</holo>>
<br>
<<if setup.arcology.hasClearance("resident")>>
	As you approach the glass wall, a consultant working on the other side notices you and checks a nearby screen.
	"You have permission to use these services, but we're not taking appointments yet. You'll have to come back later this season."
<<else>>
	You try to walk closer to the glass wall, but red lights appear on the floor around your feet. A voice from a nearby speaker asks you to return to the public area.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Back|Arcology X-Change Station]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Arcology Glasshouse Door
<<location "arcology_glassdoor">><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>>
<<set _gdParty to $xchange.arcology.party>>
<<set _gdRevoked to $xchange.arcology.guest and $xchange.arcology.guest.status is "revoked">>
The Glasshouse has a small lobby with dim lights. At the back of the room, you see the doors to a private lift, surrounded by a gold frame.
<br><br>
<<if _gdRevoked or (_gdParty and _gdParty.status is "failed")>>
	As you approach, the scanner checks your implant and shows a red light. A security guard standing near the lift notices this and walks towards you.
	"You're not allowed inside. Please leave the building."
	<br>
	<<holoNotice "THE GLASSHOUSE" "ENTRY DENIED. ACCESS BLOCKED." "denied">>
<<elseif _gdParty and _gdParty.status is "invited">>
	As you approach, the scanner checks the implant behind your ear and lights up gold. A member of staff looks at a tablet to check your invitation, then smiles at you.
	<<if setup.arcology.partyOpen()>>
		"Luchifen is waiting by the lift. Go on through."
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Go to the lift|Arcology Party Lift]]>><</link>>
	<<elseif setup.arcology.partyMissed()>>
		"The party has finished. Wait here. I'll let Luchifen know you're here."
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Wait|Arcology Party Failed]]>><<set _gdParty.why to "missed">><</link>>
	<<else>>
		"Your invitation is for <<print setup.arcology.when(_gdParty.at)>>. We start admitting guests an hour before that. Please come back then."
		<br>
		<<holoNotice "THE GLASSHOUSE" "INVITATION CONFIRMED. ENTRY OPENS AT 19:00." "pending">>
	<</if>>
<<elseif _gdParty and _gdParty.status is "done">>
	The scanner checks the implant behind your ear, but its light stays white. A member of staff looks up and recognises you.
	"Welcome back. Unfortunately, you don't have an invitation for tonight. The upper floors are being used for a private event, so we can't let you in."
	<br>
	<<holoNotice "THE GLASSHOUSE" "NO INVITATION FOR TONIGHT." "pending">>
<<else>>
	The scanner checks the implant behind your ear, but its light stays white. A member of staff looks up from a tablet as you approach.
	"Sorry, you need an invitation to enter The Glasshouse. If you're invited to an event, you'll receive a message letting you know."
	<br>
	<<holoNotice "THE GLASSHOUSE" "INVITATION REQUIRED." "pending">>
<</if>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Arcology Street]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>

:: Arcology Cafe
<<location "arcology_cafe">><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>>
You are inside Afterimage, a small café with a large window facing Relay Street. Instead of a normal menu, the café uses a glowing hologram to show what you can order.
<br><br>
<<if Time.hour gte 22 or Time.hour lt 6>>
	The café is quiet at this hour. Two people who work late shifts are sitting at one table, while a third customer sleeps at the back, hood pulled low.
	The barista leaves the sleeper alone.
<<else>>
	Some customers sit near the window, talking about the different information their implants are giving them. They seem to be new to the city.
	People who live here sit near the back of the café, where they can see anyone coming through the door.
	<br><br>
	Behind the counter, the barista has shiny metal fingers and uses three coffee machines at the same time without looking at them.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<set _cfP to setup.arcologyPrice.quote("coffee")>>
<<if setup.arcologyFx.crisis() gte 2>>
	A sign behind the counter says <span class="blue">Cipher payments are suspended</span> until the exchange settles.
	<br>
<<elseif setup.arcologyPrice.affordable(_cfP)>>
	<span class="arc-priced"><<foodicon "coffee">><<link `"Buy a coffee (" + _cfP.label + ", 0:15)"` "Arcology Cafe">><<if setup.arcologyPrice.pay("coffee")>><<pass 15>><<tiredness -2>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>></span><<ltiredness>><<lstress>><<arcologyPriceNote _cfP>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<span class="blue">A coffee costs <<print _cfP.label>>.</span>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if !$daily.arcologyCitizens or !$daily.arcologyCitizens["Arcology Cafe"]>>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[Talk to another visitor (0:10)|Arcology Citizen]]>><<pass 10>><<generate1>><<person1>><<run setup.arcology.newCitizen("guest", "Arcology Cafe", "city")>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Arcology Street]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
